{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33026","headline":"蓟北门行 · 曹邺","name":"蓟北门行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长河冻如石，征人夜中戍。\n但恐筋力尽，敢惮将军遇。\n古来死未歇，白骨碍官路。\n岂无一有功，可以高其墓。\n亲戚牵衣泣，悲号自相顾。\n死者虽无言，那堪生者悟。\n不如无手足，得见齿髪暮。\n乃知七尺躯，却是速死具。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}